{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36656","headline":"淮南高骈所造迎仙楼 · 罗隐","name":"淮南高骈所造迎仙楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸾音鹤信杳难回，凤驾龙车早晚来。\n仙境是谁知处所，人间空自造楼台。\n云侵朱槛应难到，虫网闲窗永不开。\n子细思量成底事，露凝风摆作尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}